the knowledge base ceo_performance_award includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/ceo-performance-award.l4".

section 2025 CEO performance award complete implementation is:

section core constants is:

the grant date is 2025-09-03.

the performance period years is 10.

the performance end date is a value if
    the performance period years is a number
    and the grant date is a second value
    and the years after for the number with the second value is the value.

the reference stock price is 334.09.

the total award shares is 423743904.

the shares per tranche is 35311992.

the number of tranches is 12.

the third anniversary is a value if
    the grant date is a second value
    and the years after for 3 with the second value is the value.

the fifth anniversary is a value if
    the grant date is a second value
    and the years after for 5 with the second value is the value.

the seventh as well as half anniversary is a value if
    the grant date is a second value
    and the years after for 7.5 with the second value is the value.

the acquisition threshold is a value if
    the billion for 20 is the value.

the EBITDA threshold is a value if
    the billion for 2 is the value.

section type definitions is:

section market cap milestone functions is:

the required market cap for tranche for a tranche number T is a number N if
    1 is equal to T
    and the trillion for 2 is N
    otherwise T >= 2
    and T <= 10
    and the trillion for 2 is a number M
    and the billion for 500 is a number K
    and N = M + (T - 1) * K
    otherwise 11 is equal to T
    and the trillion for 7.5 is N
    otherwise 12 is equal to T
    and the trillion for 8.5 is N
    otherwise N is equal to 0.

section market cap achievement functions is:

the required market cap given a tranche number is a number if
    the required market cap for tranche for the tranche number is the number.

market cap milestone met given a tranche number with a metrics if
    the required market cap given the tranche number is a number N
    and N <= the six month avg market cap of the metrics
    and the required market cap given the tranche number is a number M
    and M <= the thirty day avg market cap of the metrics.

the required market cap in market cap milestone met for change in control for a tranche number is a number if
    the required market cap for tranche for the tranche number is the number.

the change in control market cap for a metrics is a number N if
    the outstanding shares of the metrics is a number M
    and the higher price for the metrics is a value V
    and N = M * V.

the higher price for a metrics is a value if
    the per share consideration of the metrics is a number
    and the number is equal to nothing
    and the last closing price of the metrics is the value
    otherwise the per share consideration of the metrics is a number N
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to N
    and the last closing price of the metrics is a number M
        and N > M
        and the value is equal to N
        otherwise the last closing price of the metrics is the value
    otherwise the last closing price of the metrics is the value.

market cap milestone met for change in control for a tranche number with a metrics if
    the required market cap in market cap milestone met for change in control for the tranche number is a number N
    and the change in control market cap for the metrics is a number M
    and N <= M.

section operational milestone functions is:

operational milestone met for a tranche number T with a metrics if
    1 is equal to T
    and the tesla vehicles delivered of the metrics is a number N
    and the million for 20 is a number M
    and N >= M
    or all of
        it is not the case that 1 is equal to T
        and 2 is equal to T
            and the active FSD subscriptions of the metrics is a number K
            and the million for 10 is a number P
            and K >= P
            or all of
                it is not the case that 2 is equal to T
                and 3 is equal to T
                    and the bots delivered of the metrics is a number Q
                    and the million for 1 is a number R
                    and Q >= R
                    or all of
                        it is not the case that 3 is equal to T
                        and 4 is equal to T
                            and the robotaxis in operation of the metrics is a number S
                            and the million for 1 is a number U
                            and S >= U
                            or T >= 5
                                and it is not the case that 4 is equal to T
                                and T <= 12
                                and EBITDA milestone met for T with the metrics.

EBITDA milestone met for a tranche number T with a metrics if
    5 is equal to T
    and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number N
    and the billion for 50 is a number M
    and N >= M
    or all of
        it is not the case that 5 is equal to T
        and 6 is equal to T
            and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number K
            and the billion for 80 is a number P
            and K >= P
            or all of
                it is not the case that 6 is equal to T
                and 7 is equal to T
                    and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number Q
                    and the billion for 130 is a number R
                    and Q >= R
                    or all of
                        it is not the case that 7 is equal to T
                        and 8 is equal to T
                            and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number S
                            and the billion for 210 is a number U
                            and S >= U
                            or all of
                                it is not the case that 8 is equal to T
                                and 9 is equal to T
                                    and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number V
                                    and the billion for 300 is a number W
                                    and V >= W
                                    or T >= 10
                                        and it is not the case that 9 is equal to T
                                        and T <= 12
                                        and the current adjusted EBITDA of the metrics is a number X
                                        and the billion for 400 is a number Y
                                        and X >= Y.

section deemed achievement logic is:

deemed achievement applies for a tranche number with an award state if
    the third anniversary is a value V
    and the current date of the award state >= V
    and the award state has covered event occurred
    and covered event affects product goals for the tranche number with the award state
    and all market cap averages met for the tranche number with the performance metrics of the award state.

covered event affects product goals for a tranche number T with an award state if
    T >= 2
    and T <= 4
    and the covered event type of the award state is a covered event type
    and the covered event type is equal to external_event_affecting_product_goals.

the required market cap in all market cap averages met for a tranche number is a number if
    the required market cap for tranche for the tranche number is the number.

all market cap averages met for a tranche number with a metrics if
    the required market cap in all market cap averages met for the tranche number is a number N
    and N >= the thirty day avg market cap of the metrics
    and the required market cap in all market cap averages met for the tranche number is a number M
    and M >= the six month avg market cap of the metrics
    and the required market cap in all market cap averages met for the tranche number is a number K
    and K >= the one year avg market cap of the metrics.

section earning logic is:

tranche can be earned for a tranche number with an award state if
    the performance metrics of the award state is a tesla performance metrics
    and market cap milestone met given the tranche number with the tesla performance metrics
    or deemed achievement applies for the tranche number with the award state
        and the performance metrics of the award state is a second tesla performance metrics
        and market cap milestone met for change in control for the tranche number with the second tesla performance metrics
    and the performance metrics of the award state is a third tesla performance metrics
        and operational milestone met for the tranche number with the third tesla performance metrics
        or deemed achievement applies for the tranche number with the award state
    and musk in eligible service for the award state
    and CEO succession framework required met for the tranche number with the award state
    and it is not the case that tranche already earned for the tranche number with the award state
    and it is not the case that operational milestone already used for the tranche number with the award state
    and issuance conditions met for the award state.

musk in eligible service for an award state if
    the musk service status of the award state is chief_executive_officer
    or the musk service status of the award state is executive_officer_product_development.

CEO succession framework required met for a tranche number T with an award state if
    T >= 11
    and the award state has CEO succession framework
    or it is not the case that T >= 11.

tranche already earned for a tranche number with an award state if
    number in the tranche number for the earned tranches of the award state.

operational milestone already used for a tranche number T with an award state if
    T >= 1
    and T <= 4
    and product goal already used for T with the award state.

product goal already used for a tranche number with an award state if
    any earned tranche uses same product goal for the tranche number with the earned tranches of the award state.

issuance conditions met for an award state if
    the award state has HSR waiting period expired
    and the award state has shareholder approval received.

section vesting logic is:

the determine vesting category for an earn date E is a vesting category if
    the fifth anniversary is a value V
    and E <= V
    and the vesting category is equal to seven_as_well_as_half_year_earned_shares
    otherwise the vesting category is equal to ten_year_earned_shares.

the determine vesting date for a vesting category is a date if
    seven_as_well_as_half_year_earned_shares is equal to the vesting category
    and the seventh as well as half anniversary is the date
    otherwise the performance end date is the date.

the vesting category for an earn date is a vesting category if
    the determine vesting category for the earn date is the vesting category.

the vesting date for an earn date is a date if
    the vesting category for the earn date is a vesting category
    and the determine vesting date for the vesting category is the date.

tranche is vested for a tranche number with a date D with an earn date if
    the vesting date for the earn date is a date N
    and D >= N.

section termination as well as change in control logic is:

immediate vesting applies for an award state if
    the termination reason of the award state is a termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the termination reason
    and without_cause is equal to the termination reason
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a second termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the second termination reason
    and death is equal to the second termination reason
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a third termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the third termination reason
    and disability is equal to the third termination reason
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a fourth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the fourth termination reason
    and change_in_control is equal to the fourth termination reason.

forfeiture applies for an award state if
    the termination reason of the award state is a termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the termination reason
    and for_cause is equal to the termination reason
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a second termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the second termination reason
    and voluntary_resignation is equal to the second termination reason
    otherwise it is not the case that musk in eligible service for the award state
    or the current date of the award state is a date D
        and it is not the case that it is not the case that musk in eligible service for the award state
        and the performance end date is a value V
        and D > V.

section offset amount calculations is:

the offset amount for tranche for a tranche number is a number N if
    the reference stock price is a number M
    and the shares per tranche is a number K
    and N = M * K.

section holding period requirements is:

the holding period end for an earn date is a date if
    the years after for 5 with the earn date is the date.

holding period met for an earn date with a date D if
    the holding period end for the earn date is a date N
    and D >= N.

section regulative deontics is:

section date tracking functions is:

a tranche is earned for an award state if
    number in the tranche for the earned tranches of the award state.

the get earn date for a tranche for an award state is a date if
    the get the tranche of the earned tranches of the award state for 0 is a number
    and the get date at the number for the earned dates of the award state is the date.

the get an index of a tranche for a tranche list T is a number if
    [] is equal to the tranche
    and the number is equal to 0
    otherwise prolog (the tranche=[N|M])
    and the index is equal to N
        and the number is equal to T
        otherwise a tranche list K = T + 1
        and the get the index of M for K is the number.

the get date at an index N for a date list is a date if
    [] is equal to the date list
    and the grant date is the date
    otherwise prolog (the date list=[T|D])
    and 0 is equal to N
        and the date is equal to T
        otherwise an index M = N - 1
        and the get date at M for D is the date.

section helper functions is:

the million for a number N is a number M if
    M = N * 1000000.

the billion for a number is a number N if
    the million for the number is a number M
    and N = M * 1000.

the trillion for a number is a number N if
    the billion for the number is a number M
    and N = M * 1000.

the new year for a date with a number N is a number M if
    the year number of the date is a number K
    and M = K + floor(N).

% RESIDUE r1 BEGIN: fractionalDays
% TODO: translate the fragment below by hand, or with the Contract Assistant (residue mode); it was not translated automatically
%   source: lines 492-492
% a value with no LE form: (`Days in year` OF `newYear`)
%   l4:
%   |         fractionalDays MEANS (`Days in year` newYear) TIMES (n MINUS FLOOR n)
% RESIDUE r1 END

the new day for a date with a number is a number N if
    the day in the month of the date is a number M
    and the fractional days for the date with the number is a number K
    and N = M + floor(K).

the new month for a date is a value if
    the month number of the date is the value.

the years after for a number with a date is a second date if
    the new day for the date with the number is a second number
    and the new month for the date is a value
    and the new year for the date with the number is a third number
    and the date with day the second number month the value year the third number is the second date.

number in a list for an item if
    prolog (the item=[T|N])
    and the list is equal to T
        or number in the list for N
            and it is not the case that the list is equal to T.

any earned tranche uses same product goal for a tranche number with an earned tranches if
    prolog (the earned tranches=[T|E])
    and product goals are same for the tranche number with T
        otherwise any earned tranche uses same product goal for the tranche number with E.

product goals are same for a tranche1 T with a tranche2 N if
    T >= 1
    and T <= 4
    and N >= 1
    and N <= 4
    and T is equal to N.

the forfeiture reason for an award state is a text if
    the termination reason of the award state is a termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the termination reason
    and for_cause is equal to the termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Termination For Cause"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a second termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the second termination reason
    and voluntary_resignation is equal to the second termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Voluntary Resignation"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a third termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the third termination reason
    and without_cause is equal to the third termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Forfeit"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a fourth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the fourth termination reason
    and death is equal to the fourth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Forfeit"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a fifth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the fifth termination reason
    and disability is equal to the fifth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Forfeit"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a sixth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the sixth termination reason
    and change_in_control is equal to the sixth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Forfeit"
    otherwise it is not the case that musk in eligible service for the award state
    and the text is equal to "Cessation of Eligible Service"
    otherwise the text is equal to "Performance Period Expired".

the immediate vesting reason for an award state is a text if
    the termination reason of the award state is a termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the termination reason
    and without_cause is equal to the termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Termination Without Cause"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a second termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the second termination reason
    and death is equal to the second termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Death"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a third termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the third termination reason
    and disability is equal to the third termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Disability"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a fourth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the fourth termination reason
    and change_in_control is equal to the fourth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Change In Control"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a fifth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the fifth termination reason
    and for_cause is equal to the fifth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Vest Immediately"
    otherwise the termination reason of the award state is a sixth termination reason
    and it is not the case that nothing is equal to the sixth termination reason
    and voluntary_resignation is equal to the sixth termination reason
    and the text is equal to "Should Not Vest Immediately"
    otherwise the text is equal to "Should Not Vest Immediately".

